# WearWise environment variables
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Weather: none required. WearWise uses Open-Meteo (open-meteo.com),
# a free, keyless weather API, by default. If you later switch to a
# provider that requires a key (e.g. OpenWeatherMap), add it here and
# read it only inside app/api/weather/route.ts (server-side) — never
# expose it with a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix.
# WEATHER_API_KEY=

# Optional: enables AI-powered features (natural-language assistant
# upgrade + wardrobe photo recognition) via the Anthropic API.
# Without this key, the app falls back to a fully-functional
# deterministic rule-based assistant and manual quick-add for wardrobe
# items — nothing is faked, features just stay rule-based.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional: geocoding for free-text city search (defaults to Open-Meteo's
# free geocoding endpoint, which also needs no key).
# GEOCODING_API_KEY=
